{
  "_comment": [
    "Hunt Pass seasons for Dauntless 1.6.2. The launcher lists seasons, writes the chosen key to data/season.txt, and start.ps1 hands it to the metagame (HUNTPASS_SEASON). Progress is saved per season.",
    "kind: mega (custom 400 levels) | original (as shipped) | event (as shipped) | vault (30-level Vault re-release, as shipped) | reimagined (50 levels rebuilt from the season's items).",
    "Progress for a season is in <PROGRESSION_STATE_DIR>/<UID>.huntpass.json under passes[save_key].xp; level = floor(xp / xp_per_level), capped at levels."
  ],
